},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1647.96,"y":281.73,"cell":1365,"i":45,"name":"Dewgmeagon Giant","tags":[],"note":"Locals speak of a great Giant who inhabits Dewgmeagon hills and snatches people from homes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1137.77,"y":383.92,"cell":2372,"i":46,"name":"Dewgrasp Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Dail Deities."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1211.19,"y":580.47,"cell":4321,"i":47,"name":"Steamwall Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Dail Deities."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1276.75,"y":252.26,"cell":941,"i":48,"name":"Kuldrith Pinery","tags":[],"note":"A pinery sacred to local Drakonic Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f334","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":817.81,"y":446.01,"cell":3041,"i":49,"name":"Banine Uud Palm Grove","tags":[],"note":"A palm grove sacred to local Dulandir Pantheon."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":855.09,"y":309.77,"cell":1607,"i":50,"name":"Drodh Tigers","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1290.05,"y":495.51,"cell":3578,"i":51,"name":"Putumngulf Snakes","tags":[],"note":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":442.26,"y":519.41,"cell":3636,"i":52,"name":"Nunarg Falcons","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1780.7,"y":666.9,"cell":5090,"i":53,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":535.55,"y":824.8,"cell":5955,"i":54,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1784.45,"y":341.92,"cell":1992,"i":55,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":680.77,"y":779.13,"cell":5788,"i":56,"name":"Onsaikhaan Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠵᠻᢒᢛᡰᢡᠧᢤᢒᢢᢥᢒᡴᢓᡮ᠑ᡒᡍᠱᠮᢀᡑᠳᡗᠯᠯᢡᢡᢜᡞᡆᡀᠾᡑᠠᡍᠲᠿᢤᢛᡁᡔᡠᡴᡱᢂᢛᢢᡰ᠒ᡒᡮᢥᢏᡠᡝ᠀ᡳᡟᡮᢥᠱᡎᡜᡑᠼᡀᡟᡒᢥᡯᠪᡒᢁᢥ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1680.84,"y":569.49,"cell":4236,"i":57,"name":"Stagrasp Statue","tags":[],"note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡰᡓᠵᡆᡟᠰᡐᠾᡙᠮᠿᠯᡭᡯᡑᢢᠮᢁᠳᡀᠲᡟᠲᡱᡜᡍᡙᢏᠲᡀᡳᠦᠽᡟᠼᡑᢂ᠒ᠽᠧᢜᢡᢟᡜᡐᡒᢓᡒᡐᡙᡠᢂᠱᠼᡠᡳᡴᠻᢦ᠒ᢢᢦᡙᢋᠦᡜᡳ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":867.15,"y":629.07,"cell":4768,"i":58,"name":"Bagaan Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳟ⳾ⳒⳘⳈ⳥Ⲳ ⳄⳤⳘⳘ⳩ⲼⳭⳜⳄⳜⳒⳒ⳹ⳔⳂⳭⳐⳞⳆ⳧ⳎⲲⳬⲶⳄⳔⲶⳤⲲⳬ Ⳇ⳾ⳃ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":425.88,"y":419.09,"cell":2744,"i":59,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":751.43,"y":524.7,"cell":3783,"i":60,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1406.69,"y":542.87,"cell":3962,"i":61,"name":"Ruined Temple","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1782.19,"y":586.72,"cell":4367,"i":62,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":958.32,"y":633.66,"cell":4775,"i":63,"name":"Yemayandal Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1366.51,"y":497.56,"cell":3584,"i":64,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":612.32,"y":568.62,"cell":4151,"i":65,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1196.8,"y":434.94,"cell":2944,"i":66,"name":"Ronacrossho Competition","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of speed in Ronacrossho, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":538.72,"y":230.31,"cell":759,"i":67,"name":"Thvetheasle Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Thvetheasle, offering local coal alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":1682.73,"y":431.89,"cell":2983,"i":68,"name":"Khar Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Fladia on the road from Giled. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":921.51,"y":518.67,"cell":3671,"i":69,"name":"Ulaankhan Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Alger on the road from Kacad. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":721.01,"y":621.82,"cell":4639,"i":70,"name":"Saikhan Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Khovorinia on the road from Alger. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":780.49,"y":634.65,"cell":4762,"i":71,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Tsogtno Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1252.7,"y":184,"cell":366,"i":72,"name":"Musk oxen migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of musk oxen are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1705.81,"y":533.37,"cell":3858,"i":73,"name":"Nulbundus Chasm","tags":[],"note":"The Nulbundus Chasm. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":777.78,"y":260.07,"cell":1035,"i":74,"name":"Ekh-Dekh Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1427.46,"y":413.26,"cell":2677,"i":75,"name":"Claywagoons Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":993.71,"y":755.31,"cell":5685,"i":76,"name":"Bagaano Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1246.28,"y":595.19,"cell":4451,"i":77,"name":"Shroures Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":945.48,"y":369.04,"cell":2217,"i":78,"name":"Khuming Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":915.78,"y":643.71,"cell":4895,"i":79,"name":"Bayan Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":690.74,"y":699.43,"cell":5330,"i":80,"name":"Khovorin Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":255.62,"y":315.43,"cell":1558,"i":81,"name":"Tumun Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1224.97,"y":289.84,"cell":1329,"i":82,"name":"Ronacrossho Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1708.42,"y":402.24,"cell":2708,"i":83,"name":"Drypond Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":1655.01,"y":235.93,"cell":850,"i":84,"name":"Cataclysmic Rift","tags":[],"note":"A rumoured cataclysmic rift in this area is causing nearby plants to wither and decay."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1663,"y":247.5,"cell":854,"i":85,"name":"Disturbed Burial","tags":[],"note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":656.45,"y":558.39,"cell":4029,"i":86,"name":"Disturbed Burial","tags":[],"note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":643.04,"y":158.02,"cell":163,"i":87,"name":"Thetford Tomb","tags":[],"note":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"icon":"gl